  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Iohannes filius Guidonis fateor me debere Andreae filio Bonaccursi centum florenos auri, pro quibus obligo omnia bona mea, mobilia et immobilia, praesentia et futura, quae habeo in civitate Senarum et eius comitatu ...</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si vero ad terminum non solvero, poenam dupli sortis incurram et obligatio haec firma permaneat, nec possim contra eam venire aliqua ratione vel iure ...</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Nicolaus de Salimbenis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Franciscus de Bichis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Angelus filius Iacobi</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
